      "id": 488773,
      "username": "bdinnerv",
      "name": "Ben",
      "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:02:39.182Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Since the latest update, on any purchase order we raise for a drop ship order, we get an error message when trying to save the PO which says “Shipping Address does not belong to the [company] “</p>\n<p>Is this a bug in the latest release, or is it a new “feature” - if it is a new feature, how do we save PO’s for drop ship orders which have the customers address?</p>\n<p>Ben</p>",
