      "id": 488775,
      "username": "volkswagner",
      "name": "volkswagner",
      "created_at": "2025-12-12T17:07:20.605Z",
      "cooked": "<p>As far as I can see, this has been a requirement dating back to at least <strong>ERPNext:</strong> v14.56.0 (version-14)</p>\n<p>What version were you running before the upgrade? Perhaps you had an override that is no longer working?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/f/1f32777d3ba0c386bd071a46e061cc91d0a5d772.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/1f32777d3ba0c386bd071a46e061cc91d0a5d772\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-12-12 at 12.04.52 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/f/1f32777d3ba0c386bd071a46e061cc91d0a5d772_2_690x387.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-12-12 at 12.04.52 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"4rYVpXfFvpOq3Ldi7FIoNLPomX0\" width=\"690\" height=\"387\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/f/1f32777d3ba0c386bd071a46e061cc91d0a5d772_2_690x387.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/f/1f32777d3ba0c386bd071a46e061cc91d0a5d772.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/f/1f32777d3ba0c386bd071a46e061cc91d0a5d772.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F6F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-12-12 at 12.04.52 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">698×392 24.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>I think you need to have “drop ship” enabled at the item level (see <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/erpnext/v12/user/manual/en/selling/articles/drop-shipping\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">instructions</a>).</p>",
