      "id": 488780,
      "username": "bdinnerv",
      "name": "Ben",
      "created_at": "2025-12-12T21:35:32.103Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I run on FrappeCloud with AutoUpdates - currently running 15.91.1 and before that would have 15.91.0 (or 15.90.18 - you get the point).</p>\n<p>All of my products are setup for drop shipping (delivered by supplier is ticked) and all of my sales orders have the product set to be drop shipped. This has been working for pretty much ever. I can select the customers address in the shipping address (I cannot select any of my own addresses, the filter is set to customer - I just cant save the order after I set the address, I get the message saying that the customers address is not owned by my company.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/8/f83d9a7add52207071ff654843aa0f5d2942332c.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f83d9a7add52207071ff654843aa0f5d2942332c\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-12-12 at 14.34.40\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/8/f83d9a7add52207071ff654843aa0f5d2942332c.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-12-12 at 14.34.40\" data-base62-sha1=\"zq2oDHYPrP1soG5T0ACNYfZ64bO\" width=\"625\" height=\"304\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-12-12 at 14.34.40</span><span class=\"informations\">625×304 9.77 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
